UPDATE companies SET description='Marine Engines Inc. operates from Holliston, Massachusetts, where it was founded in 1996 as a family-run business. The company has spent more than three decades in the marine and high-performance engine industry, serving boat owners throughout New England and beyond.

The company supplies new marine engines from manufacturers such as Crusader Engines and GM Marine, along with Panther marine engines for restoration and upgrade projects. It also stocks used and replacement marine engines, marine drives, sterndrives, and a range of parts including cylinder heads, head kits, and fresh-water cooling systems. The facility offers pickup near major Massachusetts highways and ships via its own trucks throughout New England, with discounted freight rates elsewhere and export capability to foreign markets.

The company''s inventory supports repowering, repair, and performance upgrade projects for a variety of vessel types.

