UPDATE companies SET description='Marmon Aerospace & Defense Group is headquartered in Manchester, New Hampshire, and operates as a collective of six specialized brands across multiple U.S. locations and one in the United Kingdom. The group traces its roots back more than 70 years, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed. It is a subsidiary of Berkshire Hathaway and Marmon Holdings, with no individual founders named in public materials.

The company manufactures high‑performance wire, cable, fiber‑optic, and thermocouple products, along with custom cable assemblies, harnesses, and mil‑spec kits. In 2026, the group broke ground on a 350,000‑square‑foot expansion at its Hooksett, New Hampshire facility. The group also provides calibration, kitting, fiber‑optic training, engineering design support, thermocouple refurbishment, and field services for copper and fiber‑optic infrastructure.

