UPDATE companies SET description='Marne Plastics LLC operates a 58,000-square-foot climate-controlled facility in Grove City, Ohio, in the Columbus region.

The shop runs 18 injection molding machines ranging from 100 to 550 tons, capable of processing a wide range of resins including glass-filled and difficult-to-mold grades. Services span the full product lifecycle: tool build management for both prototype and production molds, rapid prototyping via 3D printing, and secondary operations such as assembly, vibration and hotplate welding, and post-molding embellishment. Quality confirmation includes leak testing, dimensional inspection, and automated monitoring through an IQMS system.

Marne serves manufacturers in the automotive, consumer goods, and packaging sectors. A major Tier-One automotive supplier, NIFCO, has recognized the company for high quality, responsiveness, and 100% on-time delivery. The customer base includes large automotive OEMs and a growing range of industrial clients.

The company emphasizes its nimble size as a differentiator, enabling personalized service and a one-day lead time for production parts orders. A preventative maintenance program and ISO 9001:2015 certification underpin its commitment to consistent quality and on-budget delivery.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic injection molding (100\u2013550 ton)", "Tool build management (prototype and production tooling)", "Rapid prototyping and 3D printing", "Quality confirmation (leak testing, dimensional inspection, IQMS monitoring)", "Secondary operations (assembly, vibration welding, hotplate welding, post-molding embellishment)"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Consumer goods", "Packaging"], "materials": ["ABS", "PP", "TPO/TPE", "PA6/PA66 with glass or talc"], "equipment": ["18 injection molding machines (100\u2013550 ton)", "IQMS quality monitoring system", "3D printing equipment for rapid prototyping"], "volume": "Any project volume", "lead_time": "1 day for parts orders", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["One-day lead time for production parts orders", "ISO 9001:2015 certified with IQMS automated quality monitoring", "Recognized by NIFCO for 100% on-time delivery", "58,000 sq. ft. climate-controlled facility with 18 machines (100\u2013550 ton)", "Tool build management with prototype sampling before contract signing"], "facts_used": ["Location: Grove City, Ohio -> /", "Facility size: 58,000 sq. ft. climate-controlled -> /", "Machines: 18 injection molding machines 100-550 ton -> /capabilities", "Materials: ABS, PP, TPO/TPE, PA6/PA66 with glass or talc -> /capabilities", "Industries: automotive, consumer goods, packaging -> /capabilities", "Certification: ISO 9001:2015 -> /about", "NIFCO recognition for quality and 100% on-time delivery -> /about", "Lead time: one-day for parts orders -> /capabilities", "Services: tool build management, rapid prototyping/3D printing, secondary operations (assembly, vibration/hotplate welding,