UPDATE companies SET description='Marshall Dry Goods Co., Inc. is based in Batesville, Arkansas. The company was founded in 1944 by Hassel Marshall as a dry goods store selling clothing, blankets, and a modest fabric selection. In 1985, Marshall Bentley and his father, Larry Bentley, took over operations, and the business remains under Bentley family ownership today. Marshall Bentley, the current owner, gradually shifted the company to focus entirely on fabric.

Today the company designs, prints, and manufactures more than 5,000 fabric SKUs, specializing in 100% cotton prints offered in 45-inch and 108-inch widths. Production uses both conventional rotary and digital printing methods, supporting a library of over 4,000 exclusive designs with new patterns released weekly. In addition to cotton prints, the mill produces vintage muslins, Indonesian and Indian batiks, flannel, minky, fleece, broadcloth, and quilt batting in 80/20 cotton-poly, 100% cotton, and 100% polyester, available in widths from 45 to 120 inches.

Marshall Dry Goods serves quilters, crafters, and retail fabric shops across the United States through its online store and a brick-and-mortar location in Batesville. A wholesale division supplies bulk fabric to retailers and other businesses, while the adjacent Marshall’s Quilt House provides a retreat space for quilting groups.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Fabric design", "Rotary printing", "Digital printing", "Fabric manufacturing", "Quilt batting production", "Wholesale fabric distribution", "Retail fabric sales", "Online fabric store"], "industries": ["Quilting", "Crafting", "Retail fabric", "Wholesale fabric", "Textile manufacturing"], "materials": ["100% cotton", "Vintage Muslins", "Indonesian Batiks", "Indian Batiks", "Dream Cotton solids", "Snuggle Flannel", "Homespun", "Prime Plus Broadcloth", "Minky", "Minky Dot", "Wide Sheetings", "Fleece", "Quilt batting (80/20 cotton-poly)", "Quilt batting (100% cotton)", "Quilt batting (100% polyester)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Portfolio of over 5,000 fabrics", "In-house rotary and digital printing", "Over 4,000 exclusive designs", "New prints released weekly", "Fast delivery on wholesale orders"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1944 by Hassel Marshall -> /about-us", "Bentley family ownership since 1985 -> /about-us", "Over 5,000 fabric SKUs -> /about-us", "Rotary and digital printing -> /about-us", "4,000+ exclusive designs -> /about-us", "Weekly new print releases -> /about-us", "Manufactures batiks, flannel, minky, fleece, batting -> /about-us", "Quilt batting in multiple blends and widths -> /about-us", "80th anniversary in 2024 -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Batesville, Arkansas -> /about-us, db", "Wholesale and retail sales -> /", "Marshall''s Quilt House retreat -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Over the decades, Marshall learned how to design and manufacture his own fabric lines.