UPDATE companies SET description='Marshall Food Equipment Service was founded in 1928 in Providence, Rhode Island, and is now headquartered in Cranston. The family-owned business has remained in Rhode Island for nearly a century, expanding its service area to include Bristol County, Massachusetts, and New London County, Connecticut.

The company provides commercial kitchen equipment repair, offering both on-site and in-shop service for cooking, food-preparation, ware-washing, and coffee equipment. Its technicians are factory-trained and CFESA-certified in gas, electric, steam, and microwave technologies, with many boasting over 25 years of experience. Marshall also supplies genuine replacement parts from an extensive inventory and operates a fully equipped repair facility. All work carries a 90-day warranty on parts and labor, and emergency service is available 24/7.

Customers include restaurants, cafeterias, healthcare kitchens, bakeries, and institutional foodservice operations throughout the tri-state region. The company is an authorized warranty service provider for numerous major manufacturers and services all brands of commercial kitchen equipment.

Marshall differentiates itself through its long local history, factory-authorized status, CFESA-certified staff, round-the-clock responsiveness, and a 90-day warranty on both service and parts. The family-owned structure emphasizes minimizing downtime for clients who depend on reliable kitchen operations.', certifications=ARRAY['CFESA-Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Commercial kitchen equipment repair", "On-site equipment repair", "In-shop equipment repair", "Preventative maintenance programs", "Genuine replacement parts supply", "KitchenAid stand mixer repair", "Factory-authorized warranty service", "CFESA-certified gas, electric, steam, and microwave repair", "24/7 emergency service", "90-day warranty on service and parts"], "industries": ["Restaurant", "Cafeteria", "Healthcare foodservice", "Bakery", "Institutional foodservice", "Commercial kitchen"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Factory-authorized warranty service for many leading manufacturers", "CFESA-certified technicians in gas, electric, steam, and microwave", "24/7 emergency repair response", "90-day warranty on parts and labor", "Family-owned with nearly a century of local presence"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1928 -> /about", "Headquartered in Cranston, RI -> /about", "Family-owned -> /", "Service area: Rhode Island, Bristol County MA, New London County CT -> /", "Technicians factory-trained and CFESA-certified in gas, electric, steam, microwave -> /", "25+ years technician experience -> /", "Services all brands of cooking, food-prep, ware-washing, coffee equipment -> /", "On-site and in-shop repair -> /", "Genuine parts inventory -> /", "90-day warranty on service and parts -> /", "24/7 emergency service -> /", "Authorized warranty service for many manufacturers -> /", "Preventative maintenance programs -> /", "KitchenAid stand mixer factory-authorized repair -> /", "Industries served: restaurants, cafeterias, healthcare 