UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1978 in Harleysville, Pennsylvania, Martech Medical Products Inc. began as a supplier of high-quality extrusions and molded components. The company grew by addressing manufacturing challenges ranging from the smallest epidural catheters to early hemodialysis catheters.

