UPDATE companies SET description='Medical Device Academy, Inc. operates from Shrewsbury, Vermont, with a fully remote team of ten consultants spread across the Eastern Time Zone, including North Carolina, Pennsylvania, New Jersey, and Vermont. The founding year is not publicly disclosed, nor is the ownership structure. The firm''s principal, Rob Packard, brings over 30 years of medical device, pharmaceutical, and biotechnology experience, including a stint as CEO and co-founder of a laparoscopic imaging start-up in 2004.

